## 十一、后处理与整体氛围

### 11.1 后处理链

```js
const composer = new EffectComposer(renderer);

// 1) 主渲染
composer.addPass(new RenderPass(scene, camera));

// 2) 辉光（核心）
const bloom = new UnrealBloomPass(
  new THREE.Vector2(w, h),
  1.15,   // strength
  0.65,   // radius
  0.55    // threshold  —— 调高阈值，避免暗部整体泛白
);
composer.addPass(bloom);

// 3) 暗角 + 轻微色差（自定义 ShaderPass）
composer.addPass(VignetteChromaticPass);

// 4) 抗锯齿
composer.addPass(new ShaderPass(FXAAShader));
```

**VignetteChromaticPass 要点：**

```glsl
uniform sampler2D tDiffuse;
uniform float uTime;
varying vec2 vUv;
void main(){
  vec2 uv = vUv;
  vec2 c = uv - 0.5;
  // 色差：RGB 通道沿径向偏移
  float d = length(c);
  vec2 off = c * d * 0.0035;
  vec3 col;
  col.r = texture2D(tDiffuse, uv + off).r;
  col.g = texture2D(tDiffuse, uv).g;
  col.b = texture2D(tDiffuse, uv - off).b;
  // 暗角
  float vig = smoothstep(0.85, 0.35, d);
  col *= mix(0.55, 1.0, vig);
  // 细微噪点（可选，增强胶片感）
  col += (fract(sin(dot(uv, vec2(12.9898,78.233)) + uTime) * 43758.5453) - 0.5) * 0.012;
  gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);
}
```

### 11.2 渲染器设置

```js
renderer.toneMapping = THREE.ACESFilmicToneMapping;
renderer.toneMappingExposure = 1.05;
renderer.outputColorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;
renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));
```

### 11.3 光照配置

由于绝大多数元素使用 `MeshBasicMaterial` 或带 `emissive` 的材质，光照只用于给机体一点体积感：

```js
